              <td class="xl71" style="height: 66.0pt; width: 293pt;" width="391" height="88">Beginning October 1, 1986 Respondent began providing transmission services for various New England utilities pursuant to "Phase I Vermont Transmission Line Support Agreement" dated as of December 1981 (FERC rate Schedule No. 2). The utilities paying support charges are as follows:&#160;</td>
